meta {
  name: 01_AvailableAndInstanceUsers
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: The delegator lists available users and the users of an app instance

    Given the delegator has no connection to the receiver
    And the delegator makes the receiver a rightholder
    When the delegator lists the available users
    Then the receiver is among the available users
    And an outsider cannot list the delegator's available users
    Given the delegator checks which instance rights can be delegated
    When the delegator delegates the app instance to the receiver
    Then the receiver is listed as a user of the instance
    And an instance identifier that is not a URN is rejected
    And an unknown resource is rejected
    When the delegator removes the instance delegation
    And the delegator removes the connection to the receiver
    Then the receiver is no longer among the available users
}
